Error [E0309]: `??` isn't allowed on a type
  --> type_double_optional.jet:1:31
    |
  1 | fn first(values: [Int]) -> Int?? {
    |                               ^^
 Why: An optional value is written `T?` once; there is no optional optional
 Fix: Use a single `?`, like `Int?`
